  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Africa Climate Change Fund (ACCF) is a multi-donor trust fund that contributes to the African Development Bank&#x2019;s (AfDB) target of tripling its climate financing and advancing Africa&#x2019;s climate resilience. The Trust fund was established by the AfDB in April 2014 to support African countries, to build their resilience to the negative impacts of climate change and in transitioning to sustainable low-carbon growth.</narrative>
